    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90131" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόστᾰτ-ις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος</span>,
		fem. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προστάτης, ἐὰν . . θέληθ᾽ ὁμοῦ
			προστάτισι ταῖς σεμναῖσι . . θεαῖς</span> (Dind. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐὰν . . θέλητέ μου πρὸς ταῖσι ταῖς ς</span>.)
			<i><span class="en">
			S.
			<u>OC</u>
			458
		</span></i>; <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προστάτιν ἐπιγράφεσθαί τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
				</span></i>
			<i>Bis Acc.</i><i><span class="en">
				29
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ δῆμος ἀρχὴν ἑαυτοῦ π. ἀπέφηνε καὶ
					ἐκάλεσε δημαρχίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>BC</u>
					1.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νύμφαις ὑδάτων προστάτισιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Antr.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Charid.</u>
				10
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἰδίαν π</span>., of Rhea,
			prob. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				6835
			</span></i> (inc. loc.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τοῦ Ἀνούβεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMag.Osl.</u>
					1.338
				</span></i>
			.</div>
